    "title": "You need to drive at a speed of no more than 40 km/h:",
    "options": [
     "Only when it rains",
     "During precipitation (rain, hail, snow)",
     "In all cases when the roadway surface is wet"
    ],
    "explanation": "Plate 8.16 “Wet surface” indicates that the sign applies to the period of time when the roadway surface is wet. (“Road signs”)",
